/ tbl09_sort -- xasc and xdesc
/
/ `` `col xasc t `` sorts a table ascending by that column, `xdesc`
/ descending. Give a LIST of columns to sort by several, most significant
/ first. Sorting by the first column also sets the `s attribute, which is
/ what makes later lookups fast.
/
/ I AM NOT DONE

